#: ../../source/game_specific_resources/blog/blog.rst:2
msgid "*FIRST* Tech Challenge Blog"
msgstr "*FIRST* Tech Challenge ブログ"

#: ../../source/game_specific_resources/blog/blog.rst:4
msgid ""
"The `FIRST Community Blog <https://community.firstinspires.org/>`__  hosts "
"the blogs for all *FIRST* programs."
msgstr ""
"`FIRST Community Blog <https://community.firstinspires.org/>`__ は、すべての "
"*FIRST* プログラムのブログをホストしています。"

#: ../../source/game_specific_resources/blog/blog.rst:6
msgid ""
"*FIRST* Tech Challenge program specific information can be found on the "
"`FIRST Tech Challenge Blog "
"<https://community.firstinspires.org/topic/ftc>`__. The blog hosts articles "
"that go beyond what can be covered in the `Team Email Blasts "
"<https://www.firstinspires.org/resources/library/ftc/team-email-blast-"
"archive>`__ ."
msgstr ""
"*FIRST* Tech Challenge プログラムに特有の情報は `FIRST Tech Challenge Blog "
"<https://community.firstinspires.org/topic/ftc>`_ にあります。このブログには `Team Email "
"Blasts <https://www.firstinspires.org/resources/library/ftc/team-email-"
"blast-archive>`__ ではカバーできない内容を超えた記事が掲載されています。"
